.TH SOCKLIST 8 "1998-02-09" "1st Release" "Linux System Manual"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
socklist \- display list of open sockets

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B socklist

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"

.B socklist
is a Perl script that gives you a list of all open sockets,
enumerating types, port, inode, uid, pid, fd and the program to which
it belongs.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
None.

.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.TP
.BI /proc/*/fd/*
File descriptors.

.TP
.BI /proc/net/tcp
List of TCP sockets.

.TP
.BI /proc/net/udp
List of UDP sockets.

.TP
.BI /proc/net/raw
List of raw sockets.

.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
None as yet.

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
procinfo(8), netstat(8).

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Larry Doolittle <ldoolitt@jlab.org>
